OL,3,AEthiopia fighting escalates in Tigray
OL,4,Akilling 52 civilians, medic tells the
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 52 civilians have been killed
OL,8,Fduring three days of heavy fighting
OL,9,Faround Alamata in Ethiopia's northern
OL,10,FTigray region, hospital sources have
OL,11,Ftold the BBC.
OL,13,FIt appears government troops have taken
OL,14,Fcontrol of the town from regional
OL,15,Ffighters and intend to push north
OL,16,Ftowards Mekelle, the region's main
OL,17,Fcity. Social media clips show army
OL,18,Ftanks on Alamata's streets.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
