OL,3,AEthiopia fighting escalates in Tigray
OL,4,Akilling 52 civilians, medic tells the
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FClashes broke out last week after
OL,8,Fmonths of tension between the
OL,9,Fgovernment and the party that controls
OL,10,FTigray, with both accusing each other
OL,11,Fof violating a 2022 deal that ended a
OL,12,Ftwo-year civil war.
OL,14,FFighting has also affected neighbouring
OL,15,Fregions with 33 tourists stranded for
OL,16,Fthe last week in Lalibela, a Unesco
OL,17,Fworld heritage site.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
